{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>股評人連敬涵於節目中推介中移動(941)，一來股份防守性高，基本面上逐步轉型為AI算力貢獻，相信今季盈利會有改善。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"4323.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026wtuQvZQ8j61795676152.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>連敬涵建議78元買入，目標價看84元，止蝕價定於74元。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"4324.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026t46J2MGaVn1795676192.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>中移動(941)</p><p>股評人買賣策略</p><p>買入：$78</p><p>目標：$84</p><p>止蝕：$74</p><p></p><p>股評人趙晞文推介服裝企業江南布衣(3306)，認為資金繼續追入內需股，公司除了業績穩健及估值吸引之外，預期股息率達10厘，有值博空間。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"4325.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026la9hFh4Qck1795676213.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>趙晞文建議22元才部署，目標價看25.8元，止蝕價定於19.5元。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"4326.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026II1HlBteFt1795676234.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>江南布衣(3306)</p><p>股評人買賣策略</p><p>買入：$22</p><p>目標：$25.8</p><p>止蝕：$19.5</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T08:03:05.399082+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":270,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T06:49:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T12:37:17.888545+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T07:56:29.165417+00:00","content_hash":"2bc8db4e4f699e909a8ba6e1a52dd5f50c10a93723682827c9780c7dd5f0cf6a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}